hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1545","We are Muhammad bin Muammar bin Rabi’i Al-Qaysi, we are Muslim, meaning Ibn Ibrahim, we are Aban bin Yazid Al-Attar, Qatada told us, on the authority of Anas Ibn Malik, that the Prophet, may God’s prayers and peace be upon him, said: “Stand together your ranks, close together, and keep your necks close together. By the One in whose hand is the soul of Muhammad, I am To see the devil entering through the row as if it were a deletion.” Muslim said: It means small animals, small animals: children of sheep."
